OL,3,GNEWSAHarry Kane's first club celebrates
OL,4,ABallon d'Or win
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chairman of the football club that
OL,7,FHarry Kane played for as a boy has said
OL,8,Fthey are proud of his "hard work" after
OL,9,Fthe England captain won the Ballon
OL,10,Fd'Or.
OL,12,FIan Marshall, chairman of Ridgeway
OL,13,FRovers FC in Walthamstow, where Kane
OL,14,Fplayed as a youth, said he was welling
OL,15,Fup during the awards, adding: "I know
OL,16,Fhow hard he's worked to get it, and I
OL,17,Fknow what he's had to go through from
OL,18,Fthe beginning."
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
