OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHarry Kane's first club celebrates
OL,4,ABallon d'Or win
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 33-year-old Bayern Munich striker
OL,7,Fwas crowned the world's best male
OL,8,Ffootball player and men's striker of
OL,9,Fthe year at the awards on Monday night.
OL,11,FAlex Welsh, former academy coach at
OL,12,FArsenal, said he was "ecstatic" Kane
OL,13,Fhad won the award, which he described
OL,14,Fas "fully deserved".
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
